WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.400
I'd like you to close your eyes and take a moment to focus on your breathing with curiosity.

2
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:30.400
And then for a moment, bring into your mind's eye your feet.

3
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:43.760
I often think that our feet are our hidden warriors, your feet, your beautiful feet that

4
00:00:43.760 --> 00:01:01.160
take you on vacations. Feet that when you are alone in bed go up against the soft cloth,

5
00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:10.720
or feet that may be reached out to another person's feet. Your feet that have carried

6
00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:21.160
you into situations where you've been scared. See if you can think of some of those. And

7
00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:27.360
when we do this, keep in mind that some people think in technicala and some people think

8
00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:36.360
and do these kinds of exercises in a very way that is fuzzy. Either is okay. See if you

9
00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:45.400
can let go of trying to do this exercise right and see if you can just be. Feet that have

10
00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:58.200
walked you into a hospital where you've maybe bought a child into the world. Feet that have

11
00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:08.280
walked you onto an airplane to say goodbye to people that you love. And now gradually think of

12
00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:18.920
your feet getting smaller, smaller and smaller, more tender. And gradually think of those feet

13
00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:29.480
wearing a pair of childhood shoes. Shoes that you may be used to wear as a child. See if you can

14
00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:36.040
bring up the details of those. And again, if nothing comes to mind you can just make something up.

15
00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:47.640
This is an exercise in imagination. Now I'd like you to search facts through your memories to a time

16
00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:57.160
when you remember feeling a little sad or lonely or frightened or shamed. Perhaps when you were six

17
00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:09.560
or seven. Maybe a little older or a little younger. Picture what you look like at that age.

18
00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:17.640
Imagine how small your hands were and the type of clothing you wore.

19
00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:22.600
Perhaps imagine yourself in one of your favourite artfuls.

20
00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:33.800
Now put yourself in the place of this child as if you have become the child.

21
00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:47.240
You are looking at the world through the child's eyes. Look down. You are now the child and you're

22
00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:57.320
seeing small hands and the clothes that you're wearing. Now imagine that you're going back to the

23
00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:04.600
place where you lived when you were that age. If you can't picture your exact home at that age,

24
00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:13.240
choose one that you can picture.

25
00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:25.080
Once you have the image, imagine that you are standing before the home as that child.

26
00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:34.760
Imagine walking to the front door and reaching up to take the door knob,

27
00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:40.120
turning it to open the door and slipping through.

28
00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:54.040
Look around and notice the pictures on the walls, the furniture. Notice that you have to look

29
00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:57.800
up to see some things given how small you are.

30
00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:13.480
Now, I'd like you to go to the place in your home where you might find your wise person.

31
00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:24.360
It might be your mother or mother figure. It might be a father or father figure.

32
00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:33.880
It could be a teacher, a relative, a sibling, a friend,

33
00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:42.040
someone who you know looks out for you and wants the best for you.

34
00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:52.920
When you have found the person, notice what the person is doing.

35
00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.720
Look around and see the room.

36
00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:10.520
Walk up to your wise person and do whatever you have to do to get that person's attention.

37
00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:17.000
So that that person looks you right in the face.

38
00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:29.640
They see not only your face, but they see that eyes behind your eyes.

39
00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.960
The soul in your soul.

40
00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:42.280
Once they look at you from that place,

41
00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:51.960
then from the position of your early hurt, tell the person what it is that you need.

42
00:06:56.440 --> 00:07:07.800
Tell her or him tell them what it is you need, maybe it's love or kindness,

43
00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:14.840
understanding, forgiveness, nurturing acceptance.

44
00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:32.600
Just notice what it's like or another person just to be present with you.

45
00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:45.640
See if you can stay with a simple reality that there is another person over there looking at you.

46
00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:53.080
See if you can let go of your sense of wanting to do this right.

47
00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:07.080
Now gently pull away from the person and begin to walk to the front door.

48
00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:17.320
When you arrive, reach up and turn the knob to open the door.

49
00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:21.160
Remember again that you are small.

50
00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:31.400
You step through and you pull the door behind you.

51
00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:35.640
You begin to walk away from the house.

52
00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:39.080
Heading down the sidewalk of the street.

53
00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:48.920
And as you do this, notice that in the distance you see someone walking towards you.

54
00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:56.280
As the person gets closer, you see that it is an adult walking towards you.

55
00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:04.520
And as you get closer, you realise that it is you.

56
00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:09.720
It is the adult you you are today.

57
00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:19.880
Go up to the adult that you see before you.

58
00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:27.640
You are now the little child and you are seeing the adult version of you in front of you.

59
00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:36.280
Do whatever you have to do to get that person's attention.

60
00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:46.040
So that the adult version of you looks the child version of you right in the face.

61
00:09:46.200 --> 00:10:03.480
Once you have that person's attention from the place of hurt, ask for what you need.

62
00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:14.680
The child version of you right now is asking the adult version of you for what you need.

63
00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:39.000
And now as the adult, tell the child what you need from her.

64
00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:53.000
Now imagine you are leaving the scene of meeting the adult you on the sidewalk.

65
00:10:54.680 --> 00:11:00.200
And if you transport it back to this very moment, to this room, to this chair,

66
00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:05.080
you are now the adult that you know today.

67
00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:13.960
Now imagine that the little child, the child you were just a moment ago is standing

68
00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:17.240
right outside the door of this room.

69
00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:24.840
The child is opening the door and stepping inside.

70
00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:37.160
Imagine that the child is walking toward you and comes and stands right before you

71
00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:41.880
and as they stand right before you give your attention.

72
00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:49.240
Look the little child right in your eyes and see what the child needs.

73
00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:59.720
And whatever the child asks for, give it to her, give it to him, give it to them.

74
00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:09.400
This is an exercise in imagination you can give the child in front of you whatever it needs.

75
00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:15.000
Notice if there is any withholding in you.

76
00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:20.920
Check to see whether you are resisting anything.

77
00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:29.080
And if so, see if you can let that go and give the child what it needs.

78
00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:39.240
Tell the child that you are here and that you will help in any way you can.

79
00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:45.800
If the child asks you to take him or her, then somewhere special go ahead and do it.

80
00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:51.240
Offer a hug, a kiss, words of kindness.

81
00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:55.000
This is an exercise in imagination.

82
00:12:55.960 --> 00:13:01.720
And if the younger child doesn't know what he or she wants or doesn't trust you,

83
00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:10.600
let them know that that is fine, that you are here for support and will help in whatever way you can.

84
00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:19.160
Now imagine that the child is climbing into your left,

85
00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:23.320
is melting into you, becoming a part of you.

86
00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:32.120
Continue to radiate caring and kindness towards the younger you in any way you can.

87
00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:41.720
Once you have a sense that this younger you has accepted, you're caring in your kindness.

88
00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:47.400
Let the child be, bring awareness to your breathing

89
00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:52.520
and bring yourself back when you are ready.
